hamsterdan-testing
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of the ReadinessModel oracle of Hamsterdan
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/hamsterdan), pinned under
upstream/hamsterdan. It follows the behavior of
src/hamsterdan/testing/readiness.py, and its test suite ports the upstream
tests in tests/unit/testing/test_readiness_model.py. The committed corpus
under test/corpus was produced by running the upstream code with the script
in scripts/.

